# `git.checkout`

Checkout a ref/branch in the caller's worktree.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.git.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `workspace_id` | `string` |
| `refname` | `string` |

